This product includes software originally developed and first published
by Yuriy Orlov in August 2026 at https://github.com/yurgeno/taut.

TAUT implements the "workspace as a build artifact" approach to managing
AI-agent toolchains: a harness-neutral data pack, reviewed and versioned
in git, is compiled into per-harness agent workspaces and pinned by a
lock file carrying per-artifact checksums, enforced at runtime by a
fail-closed integrity gate. This design and its terminology were
conceived and first published by Yuriy Orlov.

